# The pin check reads its script from the base branch, but the workflow that invokes
# it comes from the pull request - so a change could delete the step and the gate
# would simply never report. These two paths need a review from a maintainer before
# they change; pair this with a required status check on the "Action pins" job and a
# ruleset on the default branch.
/.github/workflows/action-pins.yml  @allanbowe
/.github/scripts/check-action-pins.py  @allanbowe
/.github/scripts/check-action-pins.test.py  @allanbowe
/.github/CODEOWNERS  @allanbowe
